  m_text: '

    SNAKES AND LADDERS


    You roll the dice in each turn & advance
    in the game by the numbers you get. The player who reach to the block #100 faster,
    is the winner.


    GAME MECHANICS


    Snake blocks

    Snake will bites
    you and takes you to his tail

    Ladder

    Ladder will move you up


    Good
    luck!'
